<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:33:00 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>OpenAI 加入 PORTS-Pike 项目</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/openai-joins-ports-pike-project</link><description>扩大社区投资并支持俄亥俄州南部数千个就业岗位。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/openai-joins-ports-pike-project.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:32:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/openai-joins-ports-pike-project</guid></item><item><title>儿童中枢神经系统肿瘤溶瘤病毒治疗的临床和转化进展</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/clinical-and-translational-progress-in-oncolytic-virotherapy-for-pediatric-cns-tumors</link><description>儿童中枢神经系统 (CNS) 肿瘤是儿童癌症相关死亡的主要原因。针对儿童中枢神经系统肿瘤的更有效疗法的开发进展缓慢，这凸显了对新颖和创新方法的迫切需要。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/clinical-and-translational-progress-in-oncolytic-virotherapy-for-pediatric-cns-tumors.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:17:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/clinical-and-translational-progress-in-oncolytic-virotherapy-for-pediatric-cns-tumors</guid></item><item><title>流体理论进入 21 世纪</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/theory-of-fluids-enters-the-21st-century</link><description>从 1800 年代到 2000 年代初，物理学家使用相同的理论来理解流体的行为。现在，他们利用现代的见解，自下而上地重新定义了流体。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/theory-of-fluids-enters-the-21st-century2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:02:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/theory-of-fluids-enters-the-21st-century</guid></item><item><title>莫尔晶体中的电子探索更高维度的量子世界</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/electrons-in-moire-crystals-explore-higherdimensional-quantum-worlds</link><description>麻省理工学院的物理学家发现了 3D“莫尔晶体”，可以将四维量子材料模拟到 T。这一发现对超导和先进电子学具有重要意义。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/electrons-in-moire-crystals-explore-higherdimensional-quantum-worlds.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 23:47:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/electrons-in-moire-crystals-explore-higherdimensional-quantum-worlds</guid></item><item><title>灵活的大脑回路可以在不同的任务之间切换</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/flexible-brain-circuits-can-switch-between-different-tasks</link><description>“我们发现，大脑不会为每种类型的信息分配单独的神经元组。相反，它使用相同的神经元群对不同类型的信息执行相同的计算，这意味着相同的神经元子集可以在工作记忆中同时保存动作和感觉刺激，”麻省理工学院博士后、这项新研究的主要作者 Yuma Osako 说。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/flexible-brain-circuits-can-switch-between-different-tasks2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 23:32:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/flexible-brain-circuits-can-switch-between-different-tasks</guid></item><item><title>西澳大利亚海域的海豚在海底觅食时，嘴里衔着海绵，工具使用行为主要由母亲传给女儿，这使其成为少数受性别影响如此强烈的动物文化之一</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dolphins-off-western-australia-carry-sea-sponges-on-their-beaks-while-foraging-along-the-ocean-floor-tooluse-behaviour-passed-mainly-from-mothers-to-daughters-making-it-one-of-the-few-animal-cultures</link><description>在鲨鱼湾深水道的某个地方，一只海豚正在海底巡航，它的鼻子上塞着一块海绵，就像一个新奇的小丑配件。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dolphins-off-western-australia-carry-sea-sponges-on-their-beaks-while-foraging-along-the-ocean-floor-tooluse-behaviour-passed-mainly-from-mothers-to-daughters-making-it-one-of-the-few-animal-cultures.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 23:17:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dolphins-off-western-australia-carry-sea-sponges-on-their-beaks-while-foraging-along-the-ocean-floor-tooluse-behaviour-passed-mainly-from-mothers-to-daughters-making-it-one-of-the-few-animal-cultures</guid></item><item><title>为什么衰老可能是一个程序，而不是崩溃</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-aging-may-be-a-program-not-a-breakdown</link><description>通过破译数百万小鼠细胞的分子特征，曹俊跃发现衰老并不是随意的磨损，而是“细胞社会的重塑”。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-aging-may-be-a-program-not-a-breakdown.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 23:02:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/why-aging-may-be-a-program-not-a-breakdown</guid></item><item><title>1902年诺贝尔物理学奖</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nobel-prize-in-physics-1902</link><description>1902 年诺贝尔物理学奖联合授予亨德里克·安东·洛伦兹和彼得·塞曼，“以表彰他们在磁力对辐射现象的影响研究中所做出的杰出贡献”&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nobel-prize-in-physics-1902.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 22:47:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/nobel-prize-in-physics-1902</guid></item><item><title>人形机器人生产数量：50,000 台的说法无人能证实</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/humanoid-robot-production-numbers-the-50000-unit-claim-nobody-can-verify</link><description>广泛重复的人形机器人生产数据、特斯拉超过 50,000 台 Optimus 装置、Figure AI 超过 10,000 台部署，都不是来自公司本身。特斯拉自己的 2025 年目标是 5,000 辆供内部使用；实际产量有几百个。声称的数字和审计的数字之间的差距现在是投资者和买家应该定价的故事。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/humanoid-robot-production-numbers-the-50000-unit-claim-nobody-can-verify.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 22:32:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/humanoid-robot-production-numbers-the-50000-unit-claim-nobody-can-verify</guid></item><item><title>大豆溶血卵磷脂可对抗高盐饮食引起的高血压和认知障碍</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/soy-lysolecithin-counters-high-salt-diet-induced-hypertension-and-cognitive-impairment</link><description>高盐 (HS) 摄入是一个主要的全球健康问题，与高血压以及越来越多的证据表明认知和情绪下降密切相关。尽管盐是日常饮食的常规组成部分，但长期过量食用会对心血管系统和中枢神经系统产生负面影响，这凸显出需要采取实用的饮食策略来减轻这些不利的健康影响。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/soy-lysolecithin-counters-high-salt-diet-induced-hypertension-and-cognitive-impairment2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 17 Aug 2026 22:17:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/soy-lysolecithin-counters-high-salt-diet-induced-hypertension-and-cognitive-impairment</guid></item></channel></rss>